            make(83, "Al-Mutaffifin", 29, "إِنَّ الَّذِينَ أَجْرَمُوا كَانُوا مِنَ الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا يَضْحَكُونَ", "<ghunnah>إِنَّ</ghunnah> <hamzat_wasl>الَّذِينَ</hamzat_wasl> أَ<qalqalah>جْ</qalqalah>رَمُوا كَانُوا مِنَ <hamzat_wasl>الَّذِينَ</hamzat_wasl> <madd>آمَنُوا</madd> <tafkhim>يَضْحَكُونَ</tafkhim>", "Innal-ladhina ajramu kanu minal-ladhina amanu yadhakun", "Indeed, those who committed crimes used to laugh at those who believed.", listOf(TajweedRuleType.GHUNNAH, TajweedRuleType.HAMZAT_WASL, TajweedRuleType.QALQALAH, TajweedRuleType.MADD, TajweedRuleType.TAFKHIM)),
