            make(83, "Al-Mutaffifin", 32, "وَإِذَا رَأَوْهُمْ قَالُوا إِنَّ هَٰؤُلَاءِ لَضَالُّونَ", "وَإِذَا رَأَوْهُمْ <tafkhim>قَالُوا</tafkhim> <madd>إِنَّ</madd> هَٰ<madd>ؤُلَاءِ</madd> لَ<madd>ضَالُّونَ</madd>", "Wa idha ra'awhum qalu inna ha'ula'i ladaallun", "And when they saw them, they would say, 'Indeed, those are truly lost.'", listOf(TajweedRuleType.TAFKHIM, TajweedRuleType.MADD, TajweedRuleType.GHUNNAH)),
